 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left top)) (uuid "69e7b25c-3379-5e92-a2ca-2e8d359e91ad")) (text "MODULE PREPARATION\nRemove R16, R19, R14, U2.\nLeave U7/R13/C23 empty.\nVBUS: NC; USB data only.\nSee carrier README." (at 218.44 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8fb56fdc-5429-50b0-8d63-ea4518fb6df2")) (text "SIGNAL LABELS\n_N = active low.\nUART: carrier TX / RX.\nH1.n / H2.n: module pins.\nJP1: open except slot 7.\nIRQ/NMI: low or release." (at 218.44 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "122dcc2b-1ffc-5cf7-b2fa-4655b1497260")) (text "Slot 25 -> F1/D1 -> VSYS.\n5V inputs need powered IOVDD.\nRUN is separate from /RES.\nNo hot-plugging; flash off-host.\nUse a 5V fixture at slot 25/26." (at 218.44 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b513ea35-8c7b-5261-9649-267cf3e2175b")))
